e, fire, sparkles & highlights\n• 💥 Special-effect culling — auras, explosions, magic, rifts, quests & reward VFX\n• 💡 Dynamic-light & global-shadow optimization\n• 🌫️ Atmosphere, clouds & post-processing reduction\n• 🌊 Terrain & water optimization\n• 🖥️ GUI/camera cosmetic VFX optimization\n• 🔄 Continuous monitoring for newly spawned effects\n• 🧩 Batched processing to avoid constantly scanning everything at once\n• 📈 FPS monitoring while the optimizer is running\n\nLAVA CORE doesn't magically create performance — it reduces the amount of visual work Roblox has to render.\n\n🔥 LAVA CORE FPS","tags":["Script GitHub link  Developer Noodlesdoo"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69968e40e6483f6119c97fab","username":"Nobodyy","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/18c6f2faf3fa65469891df1fde72632669b215739c5680ccb2f5be6972b2ef57.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69968e40e6483f6119c97fab-1790722005694.jpg"},"lvl":5,"status":"offline","id":"69968e40e6483f6119c97fab","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/18c6f2faf3fa65469891df1fde72632669b215739c5680ccb2f5be6972b2ef57.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69968e40e6483f6119c97fab-1790722005694.jpg"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSpeedDemon","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-09-26T06:09:16.925Z","profile":"/u/QueueSpeedDemon"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-21T02:27:59.475Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6ab53798b5315f001397c7d3","editBy":{"_id":"69968e40e6483f6119c97fab","username":"Nobodyy","status":"offline","id":"69968e40e6483f6119c97fab"},"message":"Does the image really matter 🥀","createdAt":"2026-09-24T14:45:44.930Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6abbbecac64edf06376c73f5","commentB